{"version":1,"key":"card:155","content":{"id":155,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 CSS 我们可以为标签添加样式，那么为哪一个标签添加样式，怎么给特定的标签添加样式，这就需要用到 CSS 选择器。"}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签选择器"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接通过标签来为标签添加样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<p>酒一杯一杯的干</p>","language":"html","uuid":"4935d493-1958-4ecf-8ffe-d3234bcacdc9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"p {\n  color: brown;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"6265f92a-de3a-4470-8979-fe93dbe9e21f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类选择器"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签选择器会为所有的标签添加样式，如果只是想为特定的标签添加样式的话就比较难"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<p>床前明月光</p>\n<p>疑是地上霜</p>","language":"html","uuid":"95fd9abb-ec5c-43c4-8d44-e4833dd02bed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们想为第二个 p 标签添加样式，第一个 p 标签不要添加样式，明显通过标签选择器是无法做到的，这个时候我们需要用到类选择器。我们为第二个 p 标签添加 class 属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":".red {\n  color: red;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"e12a2aca-34c9-485e-90c5-64418087607e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类选择器的格式是 .类名，它会选择所有包含该类名的标签，为其添加样式。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个标签可以添加多个类名，类名之间使用空格分开"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<p>床前明月光</p>\n<p class=\"red double\">疑是地上霜</p>","language":"html","uuid":"f63907c4-8ae8-4604-9d90-707c60fec4dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们为第二个 p 标签添加了两个类名，red 和 double，现在我们为这两个类分别设置样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":".red {\n  color: red;\n}\n.double {\n  font-size: 2em;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"d3e83657-c165-445c-bb30-66079ee35d28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们为第二个 p 标签应用了两个样式，字体颜色为红色以及字体大小为原先的两倍。"}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"id 选择器"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以为标签添加一个 id 属性，然后通过 id 来选择相应的元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<p id=\"moon\">举头望明月</p>\n<p>低头思故乡</p>","language":"html","uuid":"33509161-cfb5-4e0c-a945-f288a652e6c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"#moon {\n  color: yellow;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"f075004f-74b9-4857-93ee-acd1c5efaaaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"id 选择器的写法为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"#id","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"名，它会选择包含此 id 名的标签。在使用上，id 选择器和类选择器相差不大，写法有所不同，除此之外它们之间还有个很大的不同，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"每一个标签只有一个 id，且与其他标签的 id 不会重复","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 id 选择器只会选择一个特定的标签，而类选择器可能有多个标签能被选中，不同的标签可以有相同的类名。"}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性选择器"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过属性选择器来选择标签，它会选择所有包含此属性的标签"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"[type] {\n  /* 选择包含 type 属性的标签 */\n}","language":"css","uuid":"8bb69f37-3e68-44fd-8e4b-e94888363b27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性选择器的格式为"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"[属性名]","language":"css","uuid":"e2f476f6-e827-4a29-ba1b-545e4aa11605","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除此之外，我们还可以限定属性值"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"[type=\"text\"] {\n  /* 选择 type 属性值为 text 的标签 */\n}","language":"css","uuid":"8365deba-3a66-4219-8279-de6d483f4741","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性值的限定不一定是具体的"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"[class^=\"a\"] {\n  /* 选择类名以 a 开头的标签 */\n}\n[class$=\"a\"] {\n  /* 选择类名以 a 结尾的标签 */\n}\n[class*=\"a\"] {\n  /* 选择类名包含 a 的标签 */\n}","language":"css","uuid":"b4cc5588-e9e3-4c86-b4ea-c175329fad08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["CSS/选择器"],"createTime":1690212303728,"updateTime":1743303640405,"linkedCards":[{"id":156,"target":{"key":"card:156","type":"card","id":156},"summary":"除了基本的选择器，CSS 还提供了一些高级的选择器，提供更多的灵活性。 后代选择器 看一个🌰： <div> <p>简单的 p 标签</p> <ul> <li><p>li里面的p标签</p></li> <li><p>li里面的p标签</p>...","tags":["CSS/选择器"]},{"id":207,"target":{"key":"card:207","type":"card","id":207},"summary":"document 包含一系列查找元素的方法，包括： getElementById getElementByTagName getElementByClassName getElementByName querySelector queryS...","tags":["DOM"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640405}}